{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1000_010azu", "source_sha256": "19ac7477c55a2e70a671ab6142c852e3cd3968967547480665ddff2b9d6838be", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私、本当にびっくりしま\nした。こんな素敵な衣装を、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我真的好惊讶。\n你为我准备了这么棒的服装，真的非常感谢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d8f79d5f7dc7de55566e81188f1f059ffca8aea9a62856490267d9ae611441a1", "ja": "気に入ってもらえたみたいで、俺も嬉しいです。\nやっぱり、カフェをモチーフにしたからですか？", "zh": "看来你似乎很喜欢，这样我也很开心。\n你会这么喜欢，果然是因为服装采用咖啡厅风格吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "6696c494f554a5ea400a165e9d31fdcd188cc7c066288567e2635464fb6235cb", "ja": "はい……。じつは私、カフェに行くようになってから、\nずっとバリスタさんに憧れていたんです。", "zh": "是的……其实，自从我开始去咖啡厅后，\n就一直很憧憬咖啡师这份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "d01a30a68717135eca1b27b6753a9955dfed9d2eddef650cff366d4ad987ff30", "ja": "制服はかわいいのに、すっとしていて物静かで。\nでも、テキパキとして……。", "zh": "咖啡师的制服都很可爱，举止轻巧而安静。\n但是，做事却又十分俐落……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "fe0ea6b98a79fd2885b3867fc7717f229aba6eb4bed994be3cc9f1a9a87b5cd3", "ja": "私には無理かなって思ってましたから、\nなおさら嬉しいです。ふふっ♪", "zh": "我一直认为自己做不了这样的工作，\n所以拿到这套服装时就更加开心了，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6e250d98aca10ba766e9d4dba5ffd6f8aa82e01dc4b31d59078ce08ecb6ff0d9", "ja": "無理じゃないと思いますよ。あずささんが笑顔で迎えて\nくれるカフェがあったら、連日大盛況じゃないかな？", "zh": "我觉得不会啊。要是咖啡厅店里\n有笑脸迎人的梓小姐，应该每天都大排长龙吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "7092d541d9105359c7d9b34f481798ddc2088b60dd4ed4f193f8b8a131b4e59f", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}さんったら。\nお上手なんですから♪", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生也真是的，\n嘴巴好甜♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "ce6c3e1071c0ba6df06a94573aef1801beb0d298ad472dc7e3f4b2b5fcc8371a", "ja": "あ……そうだ{$P$}さん。\nこの衣装、別のサイズはありませんか？", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}先生。\n这套服装有其他尺寸吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1017139292dfe97e49031d6129e3d55e42104c1cd42456b9e124c2ce48938a5b", "ja": "あれ？　おかしいな、サイズが合いませんでした？\nそれとも、もしかして……部分的に……？", "zh": "咦？奇怪了，难道尺寸不合吗？\n还是说，该不会……只有某个部位不合……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "e988b656f8c676d3c8ff8106c6b1ffcb691d0134d0e402ddc53404367dfc32a6", "ja": "いえ、環ちゃんや育ちゃん達も、\nこういう衣装を着てみたいって言っていたんです。", "zh": "不是的，是小环和小育她们\n也说想穿这样的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "0170bad23ca09c013d3d5f1d9c80dd5ddd9c46af8ea5163235bb29cdd1b5176b", "ja": "せっかくですから、今度控え室で\n『カフェ765劇場』ができたらな、と思って。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我想说下次或许\n可以在准备室里开一间『765剧场咖啡厅』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "11e218f463224f10c16681bc457853f512aa1a27fdcd98aeccb54e53d72bba50", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことですか。なら衣装はともかく、\nエプロンくらいなら、なんとかなるかもしれません。", "zh": "原来是这么一回事。既然这样，\n服装我不敢说，围裙我倒是能设法弄到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a53eed852ff4a90dcbc9d9fcc698e161458db811e1de02ef39baaf2314535435", "ja": "それじゃ、その時はあずささんに、\nバリスタ兼店長をお願いしますね。", "zh": "那么，咖啡厅开张的时候，\n就请梓小姐担任咖啡师兼店长啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "f8b8b5ac913672f2e746807456f3ff15676170c4079c2221347e4a6799b98c3b", "ja": "まぁ。ふふっ、では{$P$}さんは、\nお店のプロデュースをお願いします♪", "zh": "哎呀，呵呵，那就请{$P$}先生\n负责规划店里啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "08156cf5720e33fe1cc0d1df71933714d4050d6c82d12b7a89bc2b89042cab13", "ja": "はは、わかりました。アイドル活動もカフェ運営も、\n全力でプロデュースしますよ！", "zh": "哈哈，我知道了。不管是偶像活动还是经营咖啡厅，\n我都会全力规划的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "4afd5f0ba9c96e16e2c81276234ac6c75fb770cf1544f5fe5bb95b6238c25d5a", "ja": "はい♪　楽しみにしていますね～。", "zh": "好的♪真是令人期待～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0064_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8191ae4ad0c7d1f74e6b5bd6336762b4c9d3e1b8a88cf79faa325e9378f59f5a", "ja": "（たわいもない会話だったけど、カフェ765劇場か。\n……意外と、いけるかもな！）", "zh": "（虽然是天马行空的讨论，但这个765剧场咖啡厅……\n说不定还真的有搞头！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
